WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.633
OpenHW sits in an ecosystem where similar names label different objects.

2
00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:07.722
RISC-V International maintains the ISA standard.

3
00:00:07.722 --> 00:00:13.064
Eclipse Foundation provides the legal, governance, IP, and collaboration framework.

4
00:00:13.064 --> 00:00:20.722
The OpenHW Foundation working group aligns members on strategy, roadmaps, engineering policy, and ecosystem programmes.

5
00:00:20.722 --> 00:00:25.805
CORE-V names processor families, while repositories contain concrete artifacts.

6
00:00:25.805 --> 00:00:30.825
This lesson separates the layers and routes each question to the right source.

